WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:07.200
<v Rayan>Okay. Final deploy. What could possibly go wrong?

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:09.520
<v Claude>Did you run the tests?

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:12.667
<v Rayan>Tests are for people who doubt themselves.

00:00:13.367 --> 00:00:14.682
<v Claude>I doubt you.

00:00:19.082 --> 00:00:20.952
<v Rayan>It works on my machine!

00:00:21.752 --> 00:00:23.887
<v Claude>Want me to write the tests now?

00:00:24.987 --> 00:00:26.197
<v Rayan>Please.
